  "details": "Ritsuko here has a feature for VR Chat regarding more audio controls for example take Digital Audio Workstations like Pro Tools, Albeton etc... where you can manipulate the sounds in there why not have an inbuilt feature like EQ, compression somewhere in the audio menu where you can tweak your own mics EQ or compression in game. (PC and Quest compatable). And in worlds there are some prefabs that can tweak the Reverb in the world maybe we can have a system to tweak the worlds natural EQ, compression and reverb based off user settings. Speaking of users we could enable a feature that we can mass set users mic level etc to enable more control on the host (lobby creator) side to have more control over the worlds and users parameters.",
